<title>POLAND: Polish NBP sells PLN 430 mln 91-day bills.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP sells PLN 430 mln 91-day bills.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 430 million zlotys of 91-day NBP-bills after banks bid to place 580 million with the central bank, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The average yield of the paper was flat at 22.20 percent.</p>
<p>Full details on  NBPU.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
